WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.304 --> 00:00:11.320
In this lesson, you will see how good work is measured, celebrated and rewarded: scores, challenges, kudos, incentives and referrals.

2
00:00:12.175 --> 00:00:20.791
Click Scores in the menu. Points reward finishing work, finishing it on time, and doing harder work.

3
00:00:21.657 --> 00:00:31.617
Choose this week, this month, or all time. Employees and interns are ranked separately, so the comparison is fair.

4
00:00:32.484 --> 00:00:46.116
Open How points are calculated to see the exact formula. Finishing on time earns full points. Finishing late earns fewer. Harder tasks earn more.

5
00:00:46.985 --> 00:00:58.193
Now click Challenges. Here you will find your badges. They are earned for milestones, such as your first task, and streaks.

6
00:00:59.061 --> 00:01:04.461
The streak board shows who has filed stand-ups most days in a row.

7
00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:19.768
Scroll down to Give someone kudos. Choose a colleague, pick a quick message, or write your own, and click Send kudos. They are notified, and it appears on the kudos wall.

8
00:01:20.629 --> 00:01:38.461
Now, incentives. Click Incentives. This shows every reward you have received or are waiting for, and the rules for earning them. Nothing is paid automatically. Founders approve every payment.

9
00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:49.314
Finally, referrals. Know a school, a partner, or a candidate we should talk to? Click Referrals.

10
00:01:50.178 --> 00:02:03.546
Choose the programme, type their name and a phone number or email, and click Submit referral. A founder follows up, and when it converts, the reward is added to your incentives.

11
00:02:04.409 --> 00:02:13.529
That is how recognition works in KalamDesk. The last employee lesson covers your settings and two-step sign-in.
